UI SHELL / DESIGN SYSTEM
========================
Product: go-aethel frontend

Shared tokens in style.css :root:
- --vgt-bg, --vgt-bg-elevated, --vgt-bg-gradient
- --vgt-cyan / purple / green / orange / red (+ glow)
- Hazard: --hz-green, --hz-orange, --hz-red
- Type scale: --text-xs..xl, --leading-body
- Spacing: --space-1..8
- Radius: --radius-sm/md/lg/xl/pill
- Elevation: --shadow-sm/md/lg, --shadow-glow-cyan
- Controls: --control-h, --ease-out
- Surfaces: --ds-surface, --ds-panel

Applied app-wide patterns:
- .glass-card uses --radius-lg
- .nav-menu-btn, .cyber-button, .gw-briefing-btn, .gw-tool-btn shared control polish
- GW layout, settings modal, feed dock, research reader consume same tokens

Major surfaces restyled for layperson-friendly German copy on Global Watch
(Kartenebenen, Themenfilter, Meldungsfeed, Settings titles).
